## Interactive Features

The dashboard includes interactive filtering using slicers. Users can select different employment profiles and analyze how the dashboard metrics and visualizations change according to the selected filter.

## Business Use Cases

This dashboard can help banking teams:

* Understand the customer base
* Analyze loan distribution
* Compare customer segments
* Examine regional loan patterns
* Analyze customer credit-score distribution
* Identify differences across employment profiles
* Understand existing and potential customer segments
* Support data-driven reporting and decision-making

## Project Objective

The main objective of this project is to demonstrate how Excel can be used to transform banking customer data into an interactive reporting solution. The project focuses on data analysis, KPI reporting, customer segmentation, loan analysis, and business-oriented data visualization.

